#: docs/aspects/entity-revisions.md:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Entity revisions"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title #
#: docs/aspects/entity-revisions.md:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Entity revisions（实体版本快照）"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/aspects/entity-revisions.md:8
msgid ""
"Cross-cutting design aspect：对选定 `primary_component` 的实体，在实质 "
"`updateEntity` 前自动把**当前态**压入顶层 `entities.revisions`，便于误覆盖后"
"回滚。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/aspects/entity-revisions.md:10
msgid ""
"这不是独立产品模块；Vault 是首个完整产品面（list / restore UI）。其它白名单组"
"件本切面只保证**自动归档**，历史 UI 按需跟进。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/aspects/entity-revisions.md:12
msgid ""
"相关：[`entity-model.md`](../product/entity-model.md)、[`security.md`](../"
"ops/security.md)。代码 SSOT：`src/host/core/db/schema/entity/revisions.ts`、"
"`updateEntity` / `restoreEntityRevision`。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/aspects/entity-revisions.md:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "Why"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/aspects/entity-revisions.md:17
msgid "凭证、日记正文、任务标题等**误改往往不可逆**（尤其 Vault 密文）。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/aspects/entity-revisions.md:17
msgid "需要跨模块一致的存储与写入语义，避免每个 feature 自造 history 表。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/aspects/entity-revisions.md:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "Storage"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/aspects/entity-revisions.md:25
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| 位置                 | 说明                                                                |\n"
"| -------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| `entities.revisions` | JSONB 数组，**不**进 component `body`                               |\n"
"| 默认                 | `'[]'`；list projection **可不拉**该列（`entityListSelectColumns`） |\n"
"| 上限                 | `DEFAULT_ENTITY_REVISION_LIMIT = 10`（count；无按天 TTL）           |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/aspects/entity-revisions.md:27
msgid "Envelope（每条）："
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (ts)
#: docs/aspects/entity-revisions.md:28
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  captured_at: string; // ISO；归档前 existing.updated_at\n"
"  title: string;\n"
"  summary: string;\n"
"  content: string;\n"
"  body: Record<string, unknown>; // 含 vault secrets_enc / dek_wrapped\n"
"  tag_ids: number[];\n"
"  pinned: boolean;\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/aspects/entity-revisions.md:40
#, no-wrap
msgid "Allowlist（自动归档）"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/aspects/entity-revisions.md:43
msgid ""
"仅下列 `primary_component` 在 `updateEntity` 时自动写入（见 "
"`ENTITY_REVISION_PRIMARY_COMPONENTS`）："
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/aspects/entity-revisions.md:53
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| primary_component | 说明                                         |\n"
"| ----------------- | -------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| `vault_item`      | 凭证（已有 `vault.history.*` + `/vault` UI） |\n"
"| `content_block`   | 内容块                                       |\n"
"| `diary_entry`     | 日记实体                                     |\n"
"| `project`         | 项目                                         |\n"
"| `task_list`       | 清单                                         |\n"
"| `smart_list`      | 智能清单                                     |\n"
"| `task_item`       | 任务                                         |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/aspects/entity-revisions.md:55
msgid "加入新组件：改白名单常量 + 本表 + 评估噪点写是否需 `skip_revision`。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/aspects/entity-revisions.md:56
#, no-wrap
msgid "Write semantics"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (mermaid)
#: docs/aspects/entity-revisions.md:58
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"flowchart LR\n"
"  update[\"updateEntity\"] --> gate{\"allowlist AND not skip_revision AND 实质变更?\"}\n"
"  gate -->|是| push[\"unshift 当前态 裁剪至 10\"]\n"
"  gate -->|否| skip[\"不改 revisions\"]\n"
"  push --> write[\"写 title/body/… + revisions\"]\n"
"  skip --> write\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/aspects/entity-revisions.md:67
#, no-wrap
msgid "实质变更：`title` / `summary` / `content` / `body` / `tag_ids` / `pinned` 任一出现在 patch 中。  \n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/aspects/entity-revisions.md:69
msgid "仅 `reference_count` / `world_id` / `components` 等不归档。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/aspects/entity-revisions.md:70
#, no-wrap
msgid "`skip_revision`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/aspects/entity-revisions.md:73
msgid "`EntityUpdateInput.skip_revision: true` 时不自动归档。惯例："
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/aspects/entity-revisions.md:80
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| 场景                                        | 建议                                                       |\n"
"| ------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| Vault 改主密码只 rewrap `dek_wrapped`       | **必须** skip（并显式写回 `revisions[].body.dek_wrapped`） |\n"
"| 清单删除时子项 `parent_id: null` 等结构挂接 | skip                                                       |\n"
"| 纯排序 / unread 标记翻转                    | 宜 skip（避免挤掉有用内容版本）                            |\n"
"| 用户编辑标题、正文、密文                    | **不要** skip                                              |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/aspects/entity-revisions.md:82
msgid "显式替换历史：`revisions` + `skip_revision`（改密写回历史 DEK）。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/aspects/entity-revisions.md:83
#, no-wrap
msgid "Restore"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/aspects/entity-revisions.md:86
msgid ""
"`restoreEntityRevision(id, index)`：把 `revisions[index]` 写回当前字段；写入"
"前仍会按规则归档**当前**态。越界返回 `null`。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/aspects/entity-revisions.md:88
msgid "删除实体即丢弃全部 revisions。"
msgstr ""

